  {
    "name": "POST /api/AdItems - 创建AdItem(写操作·验证业务校验)",
    "description": "单接口测试：POST /api/AdItems。创建类写操作，2026-09-14起真实执行。实测发现该接口对itemId做\"是否属于该campaign的商品池(item group)\"校验，即使itemId是本profile真实目录商品(通过byProfile查询确认存在)，只要不在目标campaign配置的商品池内就会被优雅拒绝(HTTP 200+successCount=0+errorMessage\"Item not found\")。已用profile 16274451下多个真实目录商品(10324542/100641496/10323754)尝试添加到campaign 426321/426323的广告组，均复现同一业务校验行为，非bug。受限于没有只读接口能查到某campaign的\"允许添加商品池\"，未能构造出真正成功的创建场景，仅验证接口可达+业务校验生效。",
    "module": "AdItems",
    "granularity": "API",
    "since": "init",
    "last_modified": "init",
    "change_type": "NEW",
    "generated_by": "swagger-api-case",
    "steps": [
      {
        "name": "尝试创建AdItem(itemId不在目标campaign商品池内)",
        "method": "POST",
        "base_url": "{{WALMARTBASEURL}}",
        "path": "AdItems",
        "request_body": [
          {
            "adGroupId": 770991126,
            "bid": 0.5,
            "campaignId": 426323,
            "itemId": "10323754",
            "profileId": 16274451,
            "status": "0"
          }
        ],
        "extract_vars": {},
        "expected_response": {
          "code": 200
        }
      }
    ]
  },
